---
import { Image } from "astro:assets";

import aiIcon from "@/src/assets/images/intersection-safety/ai.png";
import dataFusionIcon from "@/src/assets/images/intersection-safety/data-fusion.png";
import equalsIcon from "@/src/assets/images/intersection-safety/equals.png";
import integrationIcon from "@/src/assets/images/intersection-safety/integration.png";
import intersectionCrashesImage from "@/src/assets/images/intersection-safety/intersection-crashes.png";
import iscLogo from "@/src/assets/images/intersection-safety/isc-logo.png";
import issLogo from "@/src/assets/images/intersection-safety/iss-logo.png";
import plusIcon from "@/src/assets/images/intersection-safety/plus.png";
import safeIntersectionImage from "@/src/assets/images/intersection-safety/safe-intersection.jpg";
import userDeathsImage from "@/src/assets/images/intersection-safety/user-deaths.png";
import Link from "@/src/components/Link.astro";
import Page from "@/src/components/ui/blocks/page/Page.astro";
import ResourceCard from "@/src/components/ui/blocks/resource-card/ResourceCard.astro";
import Section from "@/src/components/ui/blocks/section/Section.astro";
import Button from "@/src/components/ui/elements/button/Button.astro";
import Card from "@/src/components/ui/elements/card/Card.astro";
import CardContent from "@/src/components/ui/elements/card/CardContent.astro";
import CardDescription from "@/src/components/ui/elements/card/CardDescription.astro";
import CardHeader from "@/src/components/ui/elements/card/CardHeader.astro";
import CardTitle from "@/src/components/ui/elements/card/CardTitle.astro";
import Heading from "@/src/components/ui/elements/heading/Heading.astro";
import Item from "@/src/components/ui/elements/item/Item.astro";
import ItemContent from "@/src/components/ui/elements/item/ItemContent.astro";
import ItemHeader from "@/src/components/ui/elements/item/ItemHeader.astro";
import Separator from "@/src/components/ui/elements/separator/Separator.astro";
import base_url from "@/src/lib/base_url";

import Layout from "./_layout.astro";
---

<Layout>
  <Page>
    <Section>
      <div class="tw:flex tw:flex-col tw:items-center tw:gap-8 tw:lg:flex-row">
        <div class="tw:flex tw:flex-col tw:gap-4 tw:lg:basis-3/5">
          <Heading>Overview</Heading>
          <div>
            <p class="program-text">
              The U.S. DOT aims to transform intersection safety by
              incentivizing the innovative application of emerging technologies
              to identify and mitigate unsafe conditions involving vehicles and
              vulnerable road users at intersections. This initiative, which is
              specifically focused on the use of technology, complements other
              federal efforts to improve intersection safety. The intersection
              environment is well-suited to innovative mitigative approaches
              that leverage and potentially repurpose existing traffic control
              and support infrastructure.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="tw:w-full tw:max-w-4xl tw:lg:basis-2/5">
          <Image
            alt="Safe Intersection Image"
            class="tw:h-auto tw:w-full tw:rounded-2xl tw:shadow"
            src={safeIntersectionImage}
          />
        </div>
      </div>
      <div
        class="tw:flex tw:flex-col tw:gap-4 tw:rounded-2xl tw:bg-muted tw:p-8"
      >
        <div class="tw:mx-auto tw:w-full tw:max-w-5xl tw:text-center">
          <Heading size="md">Vision and Goals</Heading>
          <p class="program-text">
            <strong>Transform intersection safety</strong> through the innovative
            application of emerging technologies including machine vision, sensor
            fusion, and real-time decision-making to identify and mitigate unsafe
            conditions involving vehicles and vulnerable road users at intersections.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </Section>
    <Section color="muted">
      <div class="tw:flex tw:flex-col tw:gap-12">
        <div>
          <div
            class="tw:mx-auto tw:flex tw:max-w-5xl tw:flex-col tw:gap-4 tw:text-center"
          >
            <Heading size="md">Addressing the Problem</Heading>
            <p class="program-text">
              Intersection safety is a growing issue, especially for vulnerable
              road users.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="tw:grid tw:grid-cols-1 tw:gap-6 tw:lg:grid-cols-2">
            <Card>
              <CardContent
                class="tw:flex tw:flex-col tw:items-center tw:gap-4 tw:sm:flex-row"
              >
                <div
                  class="tw:sm:flex-basis-1/3 tw:max-w-50 tw:sm:h-auto tw:sm:p-4"
                >
                  <Image
                    alt="Intersection Crashes Icon"
                    class="tw:h-auto tw:w-full"
                    src={intersectionCrashesImage}
                  />
                </div>
                <div class="tw:sm:flex-basis-2/3">
                  <CardTitle>Intersection Crashes</CardTitle>
                  <CardDescription>
                    Each year roughly one-quarter of traffic fatalities and
                    about one-half of all traffic injuries in the United States
                    are attributed to intersections. <Link
                      href="https://highways.dot.gov/safety/intersection-safety/about"
                      isExternal>FHWA Safety</Link
                    >
                  </CardDescription>
                </div>
              </CardContent>
            </Card>
            <Card>
              <CardContent
                class="tw:flex tw:flex-col tw:items-center tw:gap-4 tw:sm:flex-row"
              >
                <div
                  class="tw:sm:flex-basis-1/3 tw:max-w-50 tw:sm:h-auto tw:sm:p-4"
                >
                  <Image
                    alt="User Deaths Icon"
                    class="tw:h-auto tw:w-full"
                    src={userDeathsImage}
                  />
                </div>
                <div class="tw:sm:flex-basis-2/3">
                  <CardTitle>Rising Vulnerable Road User Deaths</CardTitle>
                  <CardDescription>
                    Vulnerable road user fatalities are on the rise with
                    pedestrian fatalities in 2022 (7,522) at the highest level
                    since 1981, and increasing significantly since 2013 (4,779).
                    <Link
                      href="https://crashstats.nhtsa.dot.gov/Api/Public/Publication/813590"
                      isExternal>NHTSA</Link
                    >
                  </CardDescription>
                </div>
              </CardContent>
            </Card>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div>
          <div
            class="tw:mx-auto tw:flex tw:max-w-5xl tw:flex-col tw:gap-4 tw:text-center"
          >
            <Heading size="md">Proposing a Solution</Heading>
            <p class="program-text">
              Accelerate the deployment of intersection safety systems
              leveraging Artificial Intelligence (AI) nationwide.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div
            class="tw:flex tw:flex-col tw:items-center tw:gap-4 tw:lg:grid tw:lg:auto-rows-fr tw:lg:grid-cols-[1fr_0.1fr_1fr_0.1fr_1fr]"
          >
            <Card class="tw:w-full tw:lg:h-full">
              <div class="tw:mx-auto tw:sm:p-4">
                <Image
                  alt="Data Fusion Icon"
                  class="tw:h-auto tw:w-full tw:max-w-50"
                  src={dataFusionIcon}
                />
              </div>
              <CardHeader>
                <CardTitle>
                  Data Fusion Utilizing Existing and Emerging Sensors
                </CardTitle>
                <CardDescription>
                  Emerging, low-cost sensors can be deployed at intersections
                  for
                  <strong>improved sensing of vulnerable road users</strong>.
                  Data from these sensors can be fused and used in new ways by
                  AI.
                </CardDescription>
              </CardHeader>
            </Card>
            <div class="tw:max-w-20">
              <Image alt="Plus Icon" class="img-fluid" src={plusIcon} />
            </div>
            <Card class="tw:w-full tw:lg:h-full">
              <div class="tw:mx-auto tw:sm:p-4">
                <Image
                  alt="AI Icon"
                  class="tw:h-auto tw:w-full tw:max-w-50"
                  src={aiIcon}
                />
              </div>
              <CardHeader>
                <CardTitle>
                  Artificial Intelligence and Machine Learning
                </CardTitle>
                <CardDescription>
                  AI/ML can fuse data from multiple machine vision sensing
                  modalities rapidly to <strong
                    >improve situational awareness</strong
                  > and
                  <strong>anticipate potential conflicts</strong>.
                </CardDescription>
              </CardHeader>
            </Card>
            <div class="tw:max-w-20">
              <Image alt="Equals Icon" class="img-fluid" src={equalsIcon} />
            </div>
            <Card class="tw:w-full tw:lg:h-full">
              <div class="tw:mx-auto tw:sm:p-4">
                <Image
                  alt="Integration Icon"
                  class="tw:h-auto tw:w-full tw:max-w-50"
                  src={integrationIcon}
                />
              </div>
              <CardHeader>
                <CardTitle>
                  Integration of Data from Multiple Sensors
                </CardTitle>
                <CardDescription>
                  These existing technologies have not been deployed together at
                  intersections broadly, offering an opportunity ripe for <strong
                    >innovative collaboration</strong
                  >.
                </CardDescription>
              </CardHeader>
            </Card>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </Section>
    <Section>
      <Heading size="md">Initiatives</Heading>
      <p class="program-text">
        AI innovation could make our nation's intersections safer for all road
        users.
      </p>
      <div class="tw:flex tw:flex-col tw:gap-4 tw:lg:flex-row">
        <Item class="tw:content-start">
          <ItemHeader>
            <Image
              alt="Intersection Safety Challenge Logo"
              class="tw:h-24 tw:w-auto tw:max-w-full"
              src={iscLogo}
            />
          </ItemHeader>
          <ItemContent>
            <p class="program-text">
              Multiple teams competed against each other utilizing sensor fusion
              and machine learning algorithms to detect, localize, and classify
              vulnerable road users and vehicles as well as predict their paths
              and potential conflicts.
            </p>
            <Button
              class="tw:w-fit"
              link={{
                href: base_url("/research-areas/intersection-safety/challenge"),
              }}
              variant="default"
            >
              Learn More
            </Button>
          </ItemContent>
        </Item>
        <Separator class="tw:lg:h-auto tw:lg:w-px tw:lg:self-stretch" />
        <Item class="tw:content-start">
          <ItemHeader>
            <Image
              alt="Intersection Safety Challenge Logo"
              class="tw:h-24 tw:w-auto tw:max-w-full"
              src={issLogo}
            />
          </ItemHeader>
          <ItemContent>
            <p class="program-text">
              The Intersection Safety Systems (ISS) initiative is focused on
              full end-to-end prototype development and testing of systems that
              can improve intersection safety using technologies described
              above, including sensor fusion, AI-based decision-making, and
              conflict mitigation.
            </p>
            <Button
              class="tw:w-fit"
              link={{
                href: base_url("/research-areas/intersection-safety/systems"),
              }}
              variant="default"
            >
              Learn More
            </Button>
          </ItemContent>
        </Item>
      </div>
    </Section>
    <Section>
      <Heading size="md">Additional Resources</Heading>
      <div
        class="tw:grid tw:grid-cols-1 tw:gap-6 tw:md:grid-cols-2 tw:lg:grid-cols-3"
      >
        <ResourceCard
          links={[
            {
              link: {
                href: "https://rosap.ntl.bts.gov/view/dot/66622",
                isExternal: true,
              },
              name: "Summary Report",
            },
            {
              link: {
                href: "https://www.federalregister.gov/documents/2022/09/16/2022-20188/enhancing-the-safety-of-vulnerable-road-users-at-intersections-request-for-information",
                isExternal: true,
              },
              name: "Request for Information (RFI)",
            },
          ]}
          subtitle="Report | February 2023"
          title="Enhancing the Safety of Vulnerable Road Users at Intersections"
        />
        <ResourceCard
          links={[
            {
              icon: "pdf",
              link: {
                href: "/assets/intersection-safety/USDOT_Intersection_Safety_Webinar.pdf",
                isNewWindow: true,
              },
              name: "Presentation Material",
            },
          ]}
          subtitle="Webinar | March 17, 2023"
          title="Enhancing the Safety of Vulnerable Road Users at Intersections"
        />
      </div>
    </Section>
  </Page>
</Layout>
